sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Vendor as Qualified Vendor
    participant Client as Frontend (MetaMask)
    participant Backend as Express Backend Relay
    participant Blockchain as Sepolia Blockchain (OilTenderingV1)
    actor Officer as PSU Procurement Officer
    actor CVC as CVC Vigilance Auditor
    participant Keeper as Autonomous Keeper

    Note over Vendor,Blockchain: 1. Commit Phase (Sealed Bid)
    Vendor->>Client: Input Quote & Generate 32-byte Salt
    Client->>Client: Compute keccak256(Vendor, Amount, Salt, TenderId)
    Client->>Blockchain: eth_sendTransaction: submitBid(id, cid, commitment) with minEMD
    Blockchain-->>Client: Emit BidSubmitted

    Note over Keeper,Blockchain: 2. Open Phase (Automated Unsealing)
    Keeper->>Blockchain: eth_sendTransaction: openBids(tenderId)
    Blockchain-->>Keeper: Emit BidsOpened (Status = UnderEvaluation)

    Note over Vendor,Blockchain: 3. Reveal Phase (Active Window)
    Vendor->>Client: Enter Salt & Bid Quote
    Client->>Blockchain: eth_sendTransaction: revealBid(tenderId, bidIndex, amount, salt)
    Blockchain->>Blockchain: Assert keccak256 commitment matches
    Blockchain-->>Client: Emit BidRevealed (Status = Opened)

    Note over Officer,Blockchain: 4. Score Phase (Technical Evaluation)
    Officer->>Backend: POST /api/tenders/:id/tech-score (JWT)
    Backend->>Blockchain: eth_sendTransaction: setTechnicalScore (Relayed)
    Blockchain-->>Backend: Emit TechnicalScoreUpdated

    Note over Officer,Blockchain: 5. Award Phase (On-Chain L1 Enforcement)
    Officer->>Backend: POST /api/tenders/:id/award (JWT)
    Backend->>Blockchain: eth_sendTransaction: awardTender (Relayed)
    Blockchain->>Blockchain: Assert winner is tech-qualified and lowest bid (L1)
    Blockchain-->>Backend: Emit TenderAwarded (7-day standstill begins)

    Note over Vendor,CVC: 6. Dispute Phase (Standstill Appeal)
    Vendor->>Blockchain: eth_sendTransaction: disputeTender(id, cid) with 0.01 ETH Bond
    Blockchain-->>Vendor: Emit TenderDisputed (Status = Disputed)
    CVC->>Blockchain: eth_sendTransaction: resolveDispute(id, isUpheld, notes)
    Blockchain-->>CVC: Emit DisputeResolved

    Note over Keeper,Vendor: 7. Finalize & Withdraw Phase (Pull Payment Escrow)
    Keeper->>Blockchain: eth_sendTransaction: finalizeTender(tenderId)
    Blockchain->>Blockchain: Credit EMD balances to pendingWithdrawals
    Blockchain-->>Keeper: Emit TenderFinalized
    Vendor->>Blockchain: eth_sendTransaction: withdraw()
    Blockchain-->>Vendor: Native ETH transfer via low-level call
